# Copy to .dev.vars for local Wrangler/Vite development only.
# Cloudflare documented dummy keys. Never use these in production.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/
TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
TURNSTILE_HOSTNAME=localhost
# Localhost also uses these keys when unset. Siteverify is still called.
# Only localhost requests using the exact dummy secret accept Siteverify success
# with metadata.result_with_testing_key=true. Dummy hostname/action are ignored.
# Real keys require the configured hostname and action report.
# REPORT_RATE_LIMIT is mandatory, including local development. Wrangler supplies
# the binding. Production must set a real site key, hostname, and secret.
# Set a test-only ADMIN_KEY with at least 32 random characters to enable /admin locally.
# Leave it unset to keep administration disabled. Never reuse the production key here.
